     "body": "## What\n\n`Settings → Images → Image generation` (the model `magpie mcp image`'s `generate_image` draws with) lists only `<provider>/<model>` entries. Routing groups are not listed, so a group of image models can't be picked there, even though the drawing path itself resolves groups fine.\n\n## Environment\n\n- magpie v0.1.1836, official Docker image, self-hosted\n- Image providers: several OpenAI-compatible relays, each serving `gpt-image-2.5-sunburst` (referred to below as relay A / B / C)\n- Routing group `gpt-image-2.5` with three members, one per relay\n\n## Observed\n\n1. `GET /api/settings` returns `imageGenModels` with 30 entries, all of the form `<provider>/<model>` (e.g. `<relayA>/gpt-image-2.5-flare`, `<relayB>/nano-banana-pro`, `<relayC>/seedream-5.0-pro`). The group `gpt-image-2.5`, whose three members are all image models, is not among them.\n\n2. Drawing through the same group by name works:\n\n| Request | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `POST /v1/images/generations` `{\"model\":\"group/gpt-image-2.5\",\"prompt\":\"a plain red square\",\"size\":\"1024x1024\",\"n\":1}` | **200**, 144s, response `\"model\":\"<relayB>/gpt-image-2.5-sunburst\"` |\n\n   So the draw path resolves `group/<id>` and draws on a member of it.\n\n3. `magpie mcp image` exposes `generate_image` with properties `prompt`, `size`, `n`, `quality`, `background`, `reference_images`, `path` — no model argument. Its description says it draws \"with the image model set in Magpie (Settings → Images → Image generation)\", i.e. the value from (1).\n\nNet effect: a client using the image MCP can only be pointed at a single relay, not at a group of them, because the only place the model is chosen doesn't offer groups.\n\n## Expected\n\nRouting groups whose members are image models appear in that picker as selectable entries, the same way `group/<id>` is accepted by `/v1/images/generations`.\n\n## Related\n\n- #1728 — a plugin's image models not showing in the same picker (provider-side, not groups)\n- #2896 — request for a default video model picker (same settings surface)\n- #2005 — `/v1/images/generations` failover between group members\n\n## 中文摘要\n\n「设置 → 图像 → 生图模型」那个下拉只列 `供应商/模型`，不列路由组。实测同一台实例上 `POST /v1/images/generations` 用 `model: \"group/<组id>\"` 能正常出图（200，回包落在组内某个成员上），说明出图链路本身认组；但 `magpie mcp image` 的 `generate_image` 没有 model 参数，只能用这个设置里的值，所以走 MCP 的客户端没办法用组。期望该下拉也能选到成员全是图像模型的路由组。\n",
